MEMO
To:
Honorable Mayor Patrick Collins and Members of the City Council
From:
Seth Lloyd
Subject:
UDC-21-00126 Bison Business Park, 2nd Filing Zone Change
Date:
May 10, 2021

Staff Petition:
City Staff hearby petitions the Governing Body to change the zoning of Lot 1, Block 1, Bison Business
Park, 2nd Filing (the WYDOT parcel) to LI Light Industrial.

Background:
The item for consideration is a Zoning Map Amendment (zone change).  This is approved by Ordinance.

The proposed Governing Body review schedule is as follows:

Introduction and Referral
5/10/2021

Public Services Committee
5/18/2021

Second reading

5/24/2021

Public Services Committee
6/8/2021

Third and final reading
6/14/2021

Related Items:

Bison Business Park, 2nd Filing Annexation (UDC-21-00125)

Bison Business Park, 2nd Filing Final Plat (UDC-21-00127)

Planning Commission Recommendation:
The Planning Commission heard this item at their May 3, 2021 meeting and unanimously recommended
the Governing Body approve this application, with the modification that the WYDOT parcel be zoned LI.

The Planning Commission Staff report is attached and has not been changed, with the exception of the
zone change map, which has been updated to reflect the WYDOT parcel being zoned LI.

Attachments:
1. Ordinance
2. Planning Commission Staff Report with updated zone change map

